    {
      "body": "Heads up so we don't duplicate work: the same drift is in `critic/critic.yaml` (missing `strict`, `save_lora_only`) and `sft_trainer_engine.yaml` (missing `async_save`, `strict`, `save_lora_only`), and the checked-in `_generated_*_trainer.yaml` files need regenerating with `scripts/generate_trainer_config.sh` or the `autogen-trainer-cfg` pre-commit hook fails.\n\nI opened #7426 covering all three files plus a parity test. It overlaps this PR on `actor.yaml`. Whichever the maintainers prefer works for me — if this one lands first I'll rebase and drop the actor hunk.",
